    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Secret Hunt in WoW: Forever with the Night Watchman's Torch",
      "es": "Caza secreta en WoW: para siempre con la antorcha del vigilante nocturno"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Secret Hunt in WoW: Forever with the Night Watchman's Torch...",
      "es": "Caza secreta en WoW: para siempre con la antorcha del vigilante nocturno..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af38da95ebd27.95511825\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The hunt for secrets is on in WoW: Forever, and to jump in, you'll need to find the Night Watchman's Torch in Duskwood. <br><br>With the Secret Finders hot on the trail of a <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/new-dawn-waker-secret-found-in-wow-forever-383813\" data-contiguous=\"true\">secret that starts on Zephras Isle</a>, players looking to help or complete the secret themselves will need to snag a torch that was initially discovered on the Forever beta. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/night-watchmans-torch-guide-quest-location\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Night Watchman's Torch Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_torch_lit.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a>&nbsp;<a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Dawn Waker Secret Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_sword_1h_skybornec60_b_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Hidden in Duskwood lies a slain Night Watch Guard. What caused this poor guard's demise is unknown, but more importantly, players will notice that this slain guard has a quest! <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303693.jpg\" id=\"1303693\"><img width=\"700\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303693.jpg?maxWidth=700\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Night Watch Guard WoW Forever\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.55085 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a></div><br><br>This quest is an instant turn-in that rewards players with the <a class=\"q2 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280612/night-watchmans-torch\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Night Watchman's Torch\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_lit.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Night Watchman's Torch</span></a>, an item players can use to help light up dark areas around them. This item can currently be used anywhere in the world except for inns and capital cities.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303691.jpg\" id=\"1303691\"><img width=\"700\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303691.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Night Watchman's Torch Duskwood WoW Forever\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.02892 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a></div><br><br>While the torch is only used in one portion of the secret, it sets a precedent - any new content added in Forever could play a role in future (or even current) secrets, so it's worthwhile for players to seek it out. Aside from that, it's fantastic flavor for anyone looking to roleplay or even just get a bit more light in dark areas; Druids and Shamans in Ghost Wolf form can even enjoy a thematic interaction, with the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1xs7lao/stealth_update_shamans_now_hold_torch_in_mouth/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">torch held in their mouths</a>. <br><br>Looking for all the places to find the torch? Check out our guide!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/night-watchmans-torch-guide-quest-location\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Night Watchman's Torch Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_torch_lit.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The hunt for secrets is on in WoW: Forever, and to jump in, you'll need to find the Night Watchman's Torch in Duskwood. <br /><br />With the Secret Finders hot on the trail of a <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/new-dawn-waker-secret-found-in-wow-forever-383813\">secret that starts on Zephras Isle</a>, players looking to help or complete the secret themselves will need to snag a torch that was initially discovered on the Forever beta. <br /><br />Night Watchman's Torch Guide Dawn Waker Secret Guide<br /><br />Hidden in Duskwood lies a slain Night Watch Guard. What caused this poor guard's demise is unknown, but more importantly, players will notice that this slain guard has a quest! <br /><br />This quest is an instant turn-in that rewards players with the <a href=\"/forever/item=280612/night-watchmans-torch\">Night Watchman's Torch</a>, an item players can use to help light up dark areas around them. This item can currently be used anywhere in the world except for inns and capital cities.<br /><br />While the torch is only used in one portion of the secret, it sets a precedent - any new content added in Forever could play a role in future (or even current) secrets, so it's worthwhile for players to seek it out. Aside from that, it's fantastic flavor for anyone looking to roleplay or even just get a bit more light in dark areas; Druids and Shamans in Ghost Wolf form can even enjoy a thematic interaction, with the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1xs7lao/stealth_update_shamans_now_hold_torch_in_mouth/\">torch held in their mouths</a>. <br /><br />Looking for all the places to find the torch? Check out our guide!<br /><br />Night Watchman's Torch Guide</noscript>            \n        ",
