    "title": {
      "en": "New \"Dawn Waker\" Secret Found in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Nuevo secreto de \"Dawn Waker\" encontrado en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New \"Dawn Waker\" Secret Found in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Nuevo secreto de \"Dawn Waker\" encontrado en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af38e537839e5.26942057\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A new, extensive secret chain dubbed the \"Dawn Waker Secret\" has been discovered in WoW: Forever, thanks to the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/wowsecrets\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Secret Finding Discord!</a><br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Dawn Waker Overview Guide WoW Forever</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_sword_1h_skybornec60_b_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Players in the Secret Finding Discord community have helped us put together an extensive guide on what we know <b><span class=\"q1\">so far</span></b> about this incredibly extensive secret chain, starting in Zephras Isle, requiring the <a class=\"q2 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280612/night-watchmans-torch\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Night Watchman's Torch\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_lit.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Night Watchman's Torch</span></a> from Duskwood, and taking players all over the map! Although the current reward for the end is unknown, at the end of Part 1 you will be able to claim <a class=\"q2 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=276188/eluviana\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Eluvi'ana\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_skybornec60_b_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Eluvi'ana</span></a>, a one-handed sword of uncommon quality.  It is probably worth keeping hold of this in case you get the chance to upgrade it at some point.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div><br><br>Players are speculating that this is potentially tied to the secret message written on the board in the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVyhnixdPQg&amp;t\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">sixth episode of the WoW: Forever Podcast</a>. As more information is discovered, we'll continue to update the guide. Another thank you and shout-out to the Secret Finding Discord for discovering the latest secret!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1308041.jpg\" id=\"1308041\"><img width=\"500\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1308041.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Secret Message WoW Forever Podcast\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.955782 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>A new, extensive secret chain dubbed the &quot;Dawn Waker Secret&quot; has been discovered in WoW: Forever, thanks to the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/wowsecrets\">Secret Finding Discord!</a><br /><br />Dawn Waker Overview Guide WoW Forever<br /><br />Players in the Secret Finding Discord community have helped us put together an extensive guide on what we know <b>so far</b> about this incredibly extensive secret chain, starting in Zephras Isle, requiring the <a href=\"/forever/item=280612/night-watchmans-torch\">Night Watchman's Torch</a> from Duskwood, and taking players all over the map! Although the current reward for the end is unknown, at the end of Part 1 you will be able to claim <a href=\"/forever/item=276188/eluviana\">Eluvi'ana</a>, a one-handed sword of uncommon quality. It is probably worth keeping hold of this in case you get the chance to upgrade it at some point.<br /><br /><a href=\"/forever/item=276188/eluviana\">Eluvi'ana</a><br /><br />Players are speculating that this is potentially tied to the secret message written on the board in the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVyhnixdPQg&amp;t\" rel=\"nofollow\">sixth episode of the WoW: Forever Podcast</a>. As more information is discovered, we'll continue to update the guide. Another thank you and shout-out to the Secret Finding Discord for discovering the latest secret!<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
